      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] Saving `SCB-\u003eSHCSR` into `cm.shcsr` on `CONFIG_ARMV7_M_ARMV8_M_MAINLINE` is an independent functional change from fixing `cm.regs[CORTEX_PANIC_REGISTER_IPSR]` to capture `__get_IPSR()` instead of the stacked `basic.xpsr`. This change can be committed and reverted independently of the `IPSR` bug fix (and is omitted from the CL subject line).\n\nPlease keep this CL focused solely on saving `__get_IPSR()` in `cm.regs[CORTEX_PANIC_REGISTER_IPSR]`:\n\n```c\n#define CORTEX_PANIC_SYS_REG_LIST(M) \\\n\tPANIC_SYS_REG(M, __get_IPSR(), cm.regs[CORTEX_PANIC_REGISTER_IPSR], ipsr)\n```\n\nand move `CORTEX_PANIC_SYS_REG_SHCSR(M)` (along with the `shcsr` line in `docs/panic_data.md`) into a separate follow-up CL.\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/84adf0a1-0b27-4ff3-b51d-27eb83e9e93b)",
